type: dataset
title: "Prediction Market Lawsuit Tracker dataset"
abstract: "Federal lawsuits, appeals and state and congressional bills about prediction markets in the United States, covering Kalshi, Polymarket, Crypto.com and Robinhood. Compiled by PredictionScout from public court records (CourtListener/PACER docket information) and public bill records (LegiScan), with each docket and bill checked by hand. Updated weekly."
